@startuml
title MyEMS REST API and Admin Routing — System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

actor "Administrator" as AdminUser
actor "MyEMS Components" as MyEMSComp
actor "Third-Party Applications" as ThirdParty

node "Browser Environment" as BrowserEnv {
  package "MyEMS Admin Application (SPA)" {
    component "Routing Configuration" as RouterCfg
    component "User Settings Route\n/user\n[MENU.USERSETTING.USER]" as UserRoute
    component "Contact Settings Route\n/contact\n[MENU.SETTINGS.CONTACT]" as ContactRoute
    component "Tariff & Category\nSettings Routes" as ExtraRoutes
    component "Lazy-Loading\nModule Loader" as LazyLoader
    component "User Settings Modules\n(user services / controllers / UI libs)" as UserModules
    component "Contact Settings Modules" as ContactModules
    component "API Base Path Resolver\n{protocol}//{host}:{port}/api/" as BasePath
  }
}

component "Reverse Proxy\n(e.g. Nginx)\n/api/ forwarding" as Proxy

node "API Runtime Environment" as RuntimeEnv {
  node "Docker-based Installation" as Docker {
    component "MyEMS REST API Service\n(RESTful interfaces)" as API
  }
  node "Development Quick-Run\n(Linux / Windows)" as DevRun

  package "Python Runtime Dependencies" {
    component "REST Framework,\nCORS, WSGI" as Deps1
    component "Spreadsheet &\nImage Libraries" as Deps2
    component "MySQL Connector" as Deps3
  }

  database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
}

AdminUser --> RouterCfg : navigates settings workflows

RouterCfg --> UserRoute
RouterCfg --> ContactRoute
RouterCfg --> ExtraRoutes

UserRoute --> LazyLoader
ContactRoute --> LazyLoader
ExtraRoutes --> LazyLoader

LazyLoader --> UserModules : loads before view use
LazyLoader --> ContactModules : loads before view use

UserModules --> BasePath
ContactModules --> BasePath

BasePath --> Proxy : same-origin HTTP/HTTPS\n/api/ requests
Proxy --> API : forwards /api/
BasePath ..> API : equivalent same-origin\nrouting arrangement

MyEMSComp --> API : RESTful integration
ThirdParty --> API : RESTful integration

DevRun ..> API : starts service in dev mode
API --> Deps1
API --> Deps2
API --> Deps3
Deps3 --> MySQL : persistent storage\nfor MySQL-backed features

note right of Proxy
  CON-003: A reverse proxy is one valid
  mechanism only; other equivalent
  same-origin routing arrangements
  are permitted.
end note

note bottom of LazyLoader
  NFR-002 / CON-004: Route-specific
  modules are declared per route and
  loaded on demand.
end note

@enduml
